OL,3,APope's surgery to remove lump on lung
OL,4,A'concluded successfully', Vatican says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV's surgery to remove a lump
OL,7,Fon his lung "concluded successfully",
OL,8,Fthe Vatican says.
OL,10,FThe 71-year-old pontiff was admitted to
OL,11,FRome's Gemelli Hospital for surgery on
OL,12,FTuesday after the lump was detected
OL,13,Fduring what the Vatican has described
OL,14,Fas "routine checks".
OL,16,F"The operation concluded successfully,
OL,17,Fon time and as expected, and the Holy
OL,18,FFather returned to his room," the
OL,19,FVatican said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
