OL,3,APope's surgery to remove lump on lung
OL,4,A'concluded successfully', Vatican says
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, large crowds gathered outside
OL,7,Fthe hospital to greet the Pope, with
OL,8,Fsome waiting for several hours.
